# Root environment for local development.
#
# There is nothing to set here any more: `pnpm setup:env` writes `DATABASE_URL`
# into `packages/db/.env`, `web/.env.local` and `worker/.env` from
# `supabase status`.
#
# Discord OAuth credentials live in `web/.env` (see `web/.env.example`); they
# are read by the app's own sign-in routes, not by Supabase Auth.
#
#   web/            DISCORD_CLIENT_ID, DISCORD_CLIENT_SECRET
#   web/            redirect URL: ${SITE_URL}/api/auth/discord/callback
